The thing was essentially a cuckoo clock on steroids. But instead of a bird popping out, Willard constructed this elaborate scene, a kind of mechanical diorama of a working mill. I think it's a lumber mill, actually, so the waterfall is transporting little logs to be cut. There was also a tiny pond with frogs and turtles and fish of every kind. There was a mini steam engine and a boat bobbing in the pond. This clock was so popular, such an oddity,
以至于门口必须有一名警察，负责维持人群秩序。因为人们被它迷住了，以至于他们只是在店前徘徊。威拉德将3000多个微小的零件拼凑成了一件杰作，这对我来说至少说明这个男人热爱秩序。所以，这真的不足为奇，

