Willard's younger brother Harlow is going to play a huge role in the story of the Bundy Clock. But Harlow wants things Willard doesn't. In fact, the Bundy brothers couldn't have been more different. And it's clear our museum man has a favorite. Everything that we know about Willard tells us that he was a genuinely nice guy. He was well liked in the community. His younger brother Harlow was the complete opposite. He was rude.
他生硬。他是个混蛋。而威拉德，这位发明家，是个心肠软的人。据说，他简直是你所能想到的最浪漫的人。哈洛则不然。他在镇上的名声很差。威拉德很乐意花20年时间制造一个时钟。但哈洛，那个有商业头脑的兄弟，几乎立刻就看到了金钱的诱惑。

